 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Teach me something. Anything you know that I don't.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"All right. Show me when we work together. I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Found something. Follow it to the moot."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Said. At the moot. Let the fire decide what it means."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I've been sneaking out at night. I'm ashamed and I can't stop.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "It's quiet at the cache spot. Haiyan doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"You think you know me?\" Haiyan steps closer. \"You don't. Back off.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Wei glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about their secret — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'You think you know me? Haiyan steps closer. You don't. Back off.' , as it were.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "*You know the counter-attack now — the anger IS the tell. It means the accusation landed. Don't flinch.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"That's not — that's not what happened.\" Haiyan's hands won't stop moving. \"You're twisting things.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "You show them Maypop — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"Somchai is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I pace while thinking. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "\"I've got fires to light — metaphorical ones. Mostly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 18,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You offered to show me while we work. I'd still like to learn, when there's time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I buried this before the Scattering. Seemed stupid to keep it secret.\" Wei digs up a wrapped bundle — food, still good. (+1208 kcal to the pantry.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"This one — Aconite (Monkshood). Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Bottom line: Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Haiyan sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "*They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Fine.\" Sharp. \"You want to hear it? I dug it up. I was starving and your hole was right there. Happy now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Please — I can't shake it. I'm feverish, a cut gone hot and angry. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"It's not just the cut anymore, it's in the blood, I can feel it climbing. I need someone who knows wounds.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took you — The Oath, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"I show up. That's my part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Okay — I need to move. But I'm glad we talked.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Funny thing: Can I tell you something? I'm saving a candy bar for when things get better. I haven't told anyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Still on their secret.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Maypop — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"What do you make of all this? Really.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Bleak. Probably true. I keep looking for the part where it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"If I may — Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Yes. Absolutely. I've been hoping you'd ask.\" (A little too quickly.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"They took me. The Pit — up there, on the screens, in front of everyone. I'm still turning it over.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "You show them Maypop — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 41,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
